# HTML

Follow skills **html** and **poteto-html** when applicable.

- **htmlhint** required in product wiring (`.htmlhintrc` / `.htmlhint.json` / package.json `htmlhint` / CI `htmlhint`)
- htmlhint rules must keep **alt-require**, **inline-script-disabled**, and **inline-style-disabled** enabled (`true`)
- No missing `alt` on `<img>` without `html-rg-allow` + rationale; prefer `alt=` or decorative `aria-hidden="true"`
- No inline JS/CSS smells (`style=`, `on*` handlers, `javascript:` URLs, inline `<script>` / `<style>`) without `html-rg-allow` + rationale
- No external `<script src="https?://…">` without `integrity=` (SRI) where relevant, without `html-rg-allow` + rationale
- Required product gates: `html-rg-gate` + `html-hotpath-gate` + `html-htmlhint-gate`. Do not disable checks to force green.
- Prove runtime behaviour with a11y / visual checks where product needs them, not "lint pass" alone

Repeated review smell twice on an HTML product: encode into lint/CI/skill, not more prose.
